# The minimap's strips stay in the gutter T3 Code's timeline keeps beside its
# lane (1.25rem from a 640 point wide window) and never cover message text,
# here with the sidebar and the side panel open in a window just wider than
# that. Over a gutter this narrow the minimap shows while the pointer is on it,
# as T3 Code's; its marks stay in the accessibility tree either way.
fixture /long-conversation/minimap
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Long conversation" 20000
expect "Review section 14, input 0." 20000
window 660 760
capture narrow
expect "この発言へ移動: Review section 14, input 0."
expect_apart "この発言へ移動:*" "message.*"
press "この発言へ移動: Review section 5, input 0."
expect "Review section 5, input 0."
expect_apart "この発言へ移動:*" "message.*"
screenshot jumped
